## main.py — правила

### CLI аргументы (обязательные)
```python
parser.add_argument("--mode",   choices=["video", "image"], default="video")
parser.add_argument("--source", default=None)   # path for image mode
parser.add_argument("--output", default="output/results.csv")
```

### Два режима работы
```python
# VIDEO MODE: webcam loop
while video_processor.is_running():
    frame = video_processor.get_frame()
    if frame is None:
        continue
    result = pipeline.run(frame)
    visualizer.show_pipeline(result)
    key = cv2.waitKey(1) & 0xFF
    if key == ord('q'):   break
    if key == ord('s'):   data_exporter.export(result.decision)
    if key == ord('c'):   save_artifacts(result)
    if key == ord('p'):   video_processor.toggle_pause()

# IMAGE MODE: single file
if not Path(source).exists():
    print(f"Error: file not found: {source}")
    sys.exit(1)
image = cv2.imread(source)
result = pipeline.run(image)
visualizer.show_pipeline(result)
cv2.waitKey(0)
```

### Обработка ошибок в main (обязательно)
```python
try:
    video_processor.start()
except RuntimeError as e:
    print(f"Camera error: {e}")
    print("Hint: use --mode image --source test_images/sample.jpg")
    sys.exit(1)
finally:
    video_processor.stop()
    cv2.destroyAllWindows()
```

