## data_exporter.py — правила

### Обязательные поля CSV (порядок фиксирован)
```python
FIELDS = [
    "timestamp", "category", "color", "size_category",
    "confidence", "method_used", "area_pixels", "aspect_ratio",
    "color_hsv", "color_kmeans", "confidence_hsv", "confidence_kmeans"
]
```

### Append-режим (не перезаписывать файл)
```python
def export(self, decision: Decision, detection: DetectionResult) -> None:
    file_exists = Path(self._path).exists()
    with open(self._path, "a", newline="", encoding="utf-8") as f:
        writer = csv.DictWriter(f, fieldnames=FIELDS)
        if not file_exists:
            writer.writeheader()   # header only on first write
        writer.writerow({
            "timestamp": decision.timestamp,
            "category": decision.category,
            # ... остальные поля
        })
```

